01c67b0c-be52-4fd9-83a6-c50538854998	10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001	Exploring Playing With Colorful Dough: Creative Tactile Studio (Focus: Make It More Playful)	Children engage in open-ended creative construction and tactile exploration centered on Playing with colorful dough. Adapted with emphasis on: Make it more playful.	Approved	{"AgeMax": 5, "AgeMin": 3, "Create": "A tangible collaborative model or collage.", "Together": "Children share building materials and describe what they are making to their peers.", "Challenge": "Can we design and build a display inspired by Playing with colorful dough? Challenge adaptation: Make it more playful.", "Materials": ["Cardstock", "Washable craft adhesive", "Wooden craft sticks", "Textured paper scraps"], "Reflection": "What was your favorite texture or tool you used while exploring Playing with colorful dough?", "Environment": "Indoor / Outdoor", "MagicMoment": "Noticing how different materials join together to form a new creation.", "GroupSizeMax": 10, "GroupSizeMin": 4, "Accomplishment": "Presenting their completed project during reflection circle.", "ExecutionGuide": {"Ask": "How does that piece feel when you touch it?", "Try": "Try connecting two different shapes together.", "Watch": "Observe hand-eye coordination and peer turn-taking.", "Phases": [{"Name": "Welcome & Material Touch", "ChildrenDo": "Feel materials and select initial pieces", "TeacherDoes": "Demonstrates gentle handling and asks open questions", "DurationMinutes": 5}, {"Name": "Hands-On Creation", "ChildrenDo": "Assemble and combine elements", "TeacherDoes": "Circulates, providing positive reinforcement", "DurationMinutes": 15}, {"Name": "Sharing & Clean-Up", "ChildrenDo": "Place finished crafts on drying rack and tidy up", "TeacherDoes": "Leads a gentle closing transition", "DurationMinutes": 5}], "Safety": ["Ensure only child-safe non-toxic adhesive is used", "Remind children that materials remain on the table"], "Closing": "Gather on the carpet fo