51f10ff5-20ba-4174-b278-b70fdf1278e9	8a3f0f3e-9c84-4dfa-8342-f8546aedfa52	The Playful World of The Rainbow Reef Rescue	Children embark on an imaginative, playful quest centered on the rainbow reef rescue, turning curiosity into open-ended roleplay, hands-on construction, and joyful teamwork.	Published	{"AgeMax": 5, "AgeMin": 3, "Create": "A vibrant Undersea Map where children place their fish friends in colorful neighborhoods.", "Together": "Children work as a dive team to navigate the sensory sea and help each other spot hidden fish.", "Challenge": "Can you and your friends build a secret wonder-world using our materials?", "Materials": ["Colorful fish toys", "Blue sensory beads or water", "Small nets and scoops", "Colorful buckets or bowls for coral homes", "Blue fabric for the ocean floor"], "Reflection": "Which fish friend was the best at hide-and-seek in the waves today?", "ChildChoice": "Children choose their own playful role (builder, detective, storyteller, or decorator) and pick their favorite tools.", "Environment": "Indoor", "MagicMoment": "The room fills with laughter as children test their creation and discover a surprise feature together.", "GroupSizeMax": 6, "GroupSizeMin": 2, "Accomplishment": "Successfully guiding a family of fish to their colorful home in the reef.", "ExecutionGuide": {"Ask": "Where do you think this bright yellow fish likes to hide when it is time for a nap?", "Try": "Can you move your net through the water as quietly as a real fish swimming through the grass?", "Watch": "Observe how children use their tools to catch fish and whether they begin to create stories for the characters they find.", "Phases": [{"Name": "Dive Briefing", "ChildrenDo": "Put on imaginary goggles and choose their rescue tools.", "TeacherDoes": "Sets the scene with a story about the colorful fish and their reef homes.", "DurationMinutes": 5}, {"Name": "The Great Fish Rescue", "ChildrenDo": "Explore the bins, 'catch' fish with nets, and sort them into matching