nsions":["Take photos of finished structures to create a classroom storybook"],"Adaptations":["Provide larger chunky pieces for developing fine-motor grip"],"Preparation":["Cut paper into varied shapes","Set out trays on low work tables"],"MaterialSetup":["Place trays evenly within reach of small groups"],"EnvironmentSetup":["Spacious floor or craft table with accessible trays"],"TeacherIntroduction":"Today we are exploring Playing with colorful dough! Look at all these interesting textures we can build with.","LittleMomentOpportunity":"Praise a child who noticed an interesting detail in their friend\\u0027s project.","SuggestedDurationMinutes":25},"TeacherGuidance":"Introduce materials at the low table. Encourage children to test how pieces fit together.","DevelopmentalGoals":[]}	IncludedInSubscription	0.00	INR	Draft	CuratedLicensed	1	3575d272-a147-44c2-b12d-20b4e3fdc4ab	65a86559-8f85-4701-b929-f09f012b2e90	1dbd0fad-024a-49d3-a05f-ec326397f60f	20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001	\N	2026-10-17 11:38:21.181259+00	2026-10-17 11:38:21.18126+00
